{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09796","headline":"送梁判官归女几旧庐 · 岑参","name":"送梁判官归女几旧庐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"女几知君忆，春云相逐归。\n草堂开药裹，苔壁取荷衣。\n老竹移时少，新花旧处飞。\n可怜真傲吏，尘事到山稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}